abstract: "Covariance-orthonormal Fourier-type expansion for Wiener integrals of fractional Brownian motion (1/2 <= H < 1): closed-form covariance inner products, a stable matrix-free double-precision projection, numerical checks of the two-sided weighted cosine bounds, laws of quadratic functionals with two-sided bounds, measurement-design bounds, borehole design, and real-data studies with documented model limitations."
keywords:
  - fractional Brownian motion
  - Wiener integral
  - covariance norm
  - Karhunen-Loeve expansion
  - Gaussian process regression
